      "posting_url": "https://my.corehr.com/pls/esbsheseturecruit/erq_jobspec_version_4.jobspec?p_id=042125",
      "job_title_in_post": "Vacancy: 042125 - Learning Support Tutor (Wexford Campus) Contract: Specified Purpose - 2-year Panel Salary: €21.50 per hour SETU is looking to form a panel of Learning Support tutors to support students with disabilities. The Learning Support Tutor is responsible for the delivery of appropriate educational supports for students with disabilities. The role of the learning support tutor is to assist the student with their academic work and to support their ability to learn. The learning support tutor is required to work with students with a range of disabilities including specific learning difficulties, neurological conditions, mental health conditions, significant ongoing illness, physical disabilities and sensory disabilities. The ideal candidate will have excellent communication skills and a track record in disability learning support. SETU is an equal opportunities employer. #SETU",
